tX=\"688\" topLeftY=\"138\" type=\"text\">\n      <content textType=\"headline\" fontSize=\"16\" fontFamily=\"思源黑体\" color=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\" bold=\"true\"><p>7月30.1万已放量；8月MTD距目标仍差约半程</p></content>\n    </shape>\n    <shape width=\"240\" height=\"70\" topLeftX=\"688\" topLeftY=\"216\" type=\"text\">\n      <content fontSize=\"12\" fontFamily=\"思源黑体\" color=\"rgba(220, 228, 240, 1)\"><p>8月MTD 16.5万（日序18）· 月目标 35.2万 · 按日均外推约28.5万，仍低于目标约19%</p></content>\n    </shape>\n    <line startX=\"688\" startY=\"298\" endX=\"760\" endY=\"298\"><border color=\"rgba(240, 129, 54, 1)\"/></line>\n    <shape width=\"240\" height=\"22\" topLeftX=\"688\" topLeftY=\"310\" type=\"text\">\n      <content textType=\"caption\" fontSize=\"11\" fontFamily=\"思源黑体\" color=\"rgba(240, 129, 54, 1)\" bold=\"true\"><p>达成目标所需环比</p></content>\n    </shape>\n    <shape width=\"240\" height=\"120\" topLeftX=\"688\" topLeftY=\"336\" type=\"text\">\n      <content fontSize=\"12\" fontFamily=\"思源黑体\" color=\"rgba(220, 228, 240, 1)\"><p>8→9：35.2→47.2（+34%）</p><p>9→10：+23% · 10→11：+21%</p><p>11→12：69.7→97.3（+40%）</p><p>12月冲刺至97.3万单</p></content>\n    </shape>\n\n    <line startX=\"32\" startY=\"506\" endX=\"928\" endY=\"506\"><border color=\"rgba(226, 232, 240, 1)\" width=\"1\"/></line>\n    <shape width=\"700\" height=\"18\" topLeftX=\"32\" topLeftY=\"512\" type=\"text\">\n      <content textType=\"caption\" fontSize=\"10\" fontFamily=\"思源黑体\" color=\"rgba(148, 163, 184, 1)\"><p>数据：线上目标 wiki · 实际值sheet / 目标sheet（线上整体运单）· 截至2026-08-18</p></content>\n    </shape>\n  </data>\n  <note><content/></note>\n</slide>"}]